//! Canvas: drawing recorded in paint order for one page and placed as one
//! Form XObject when the canvas commits.
//!
//! Everything a canvas draws is composed into content operators in display
//! space, the top-left-origin space with the page rotation resolved: one
//! flip at the start of the composed Form maps it to the Form's PDF space.
//! Paths, clips, transforms, and blend modes are operators of their own.
//! An opacity scope becomes a transparency group Form drawn at that opacity.
//! Text in an embedded OpenType face is generated by krilla, one page for
//! each run of consecutive text items, and imported as a Form; Standard 14
//! text, images, and placed pages are drawn as `insert_text`,
//! `insert_image`, and `show_pdf_page` draw them. Those pieces describe
//! PDF space, so each is wrapped in the flip again, which returns to it.

